t </span><span begin="00:13.320" end="00:13.800">make </span><span begin="00:13.800" end="00:13.980">me </span><span begin="00:13.980" end="00:14.490">wait </span><span begin="00:14.490" end="00:14.850">with </span><span begin="00:14.850" end="00:15.060">my </span><span begin="00:15.060" end="00:15.630">heart </span><span begin="00:15.630" end="00:15.870">on </span><span begin="00:15.870" end="00:16.080">my </span><span begin="00:16.080" end="00:16.950">sleeve</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.980" end="00:21.420"><span begin="00:16.980" end="00:17.310">Cause </span><span begin="00:17.310" end="00:17.730">I </span><span begin="00:17.730" end="00:18.300">won't </span><span begin="00:18.300" end="00:18.660">go </span><span begin="00:18.660" end="00:19.170">'less </span><span begin="00:19.170" end="00:19.350">you </span><span begin="00:19.350" end="00:20.100">want </span><span begin="00:20.100" end="00:20.400">me </span><span begin="00:20.400" end="00:21.120">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.420" end="00:25.650"><span begin="00:21.420" end="00:21.960">I'd </span><span begin="00:21.960" end="00:23.430">surrender </span><span begin="00:23.430" end="00:23.760">it </span><span begin="00:23.760" end="00:24.360">all </span><span begin="00:24.360" end="00:24.630">for </span><span begin="00:24.630" end="00:25.350">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.650" end="00:29.970"><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:26.160">Friends </span><span begin="00:26.160" end="00:26.580">turn </span><span begin="00:26.580" end="00:26.700">to </span><span begin="00:26.700" end="00:27.300">foes </span><span begin="00:27.300" end="00:27.600">I </span><span begin="00:27.600" end="00:27.810">don't </span><span begin="00:27.810" end="00:28.290">know </span><span begin="00:28.290" end="00:28.650">who </span><span begin="00:28.650" end="00:28.830">to </span><span begin="00:28.830" end="00:29.640">trust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.970" end="00:33.900"><span begin="00:29.970" end="00:30.270">You </span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.780">say </span><span begin="00:30.780" end="00:30.990">I </span><span begin="00:30.990" end="00:31.830">worry</span><span begin="00:31.830" end="00:31.830">, </span><span begin="00:31.830" end="00:32.010">I </span><span begin="00:32.010" end="00:32.790">worry </span><span begin="00:32.790" end="00:33.090">too </span><span begin="00:33.090" end="00:33.750">much</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.900" end="00:38.400"><span begin="00:33.900" end="00:34.290">But </span><span begin="00:34.290" end="00:34.650">I </span><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:35.310">can't </span><span begin="00:35.310" end="00:35.670">help </span><span begin="00:35.670" end="00:36.180">what </span><span begin="00:36.180" end="00:36.300">I'm </span><span begin="00:36.300" end="00:37.410">feeling </span><span begin="00:37.410" end="00:38.130">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.400" end="00:42.990"><span begin="00:38.400" end="00:38.940">I </span><span begin="00:38.940" end="00:39.450">just </span><span begin="00:39.450" end="00:40.050">want </span><span begin="00:40.050" end="00:40.320">us </span><span begin="00:40.320" end="00:40.560">to </span><span begin="00:40.560" end="00:41.280">be </span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:42.780">somehow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.990" end="00:46.140"><span begin="00:42.990" end="00:43.110">I </span><span begin="00:43.110" end="00:43.590">said </span><span begin="00:43.590" end="00:43.710">there's </span><span begin="00:43.710" end="00:44.310">somethin </span><span begin="00:44.310" end="00:44.550">'bout </span><span begin="00:44.550" end="00:44.790">the </span><span begin="00:44.790" end="00:45.240">bad </span><span begin="00:45.240" end="00:46.110">boys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.140" end="00:48.240"><span begin="00:46.140" end="00:46.410">That </span><span begin="00:46.410" end="00:46.740">makes </span><span begin="00:46.740" end="00:46.920">the </