 begin="01:04.740" end="01:04.950">be </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.460">words </span><span begin="01:05.460" end="01:05.790">'til </span><span begin="01:05.790" end="01:06.000">you </span><span begin="01:06.000" end="01:06.510">bring </span><span begin="01:06.510" end="01:06.840">them </span><span begin="01:06.840" end="01:07.080">to </span><span begin="01:07.080" end="01:08.010">life</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.040" end="01:12.390"><span begin="01:08.040" end="01:08.640">Show </span><span begin="01:08.640" end="01:08.730">the </span><span begin="01:08.730" end="01:09.180">whole </span><span begin="01:09.180" end="01:09.660">world </span><span begin="01:09.660" end="01:10.080">that </span><span begin="01:10.080" end="01:10.260">you're </span><span begin="01:10.260" end="01:11.070">mine </span><span begin="01:11.070" end="01:11.130"> </span><span begin="01:11.130" end="01:12.120">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.390" end="01:16.980"><span begin="01:12.390" end="01:13.050">Tell </span><span begin="01:13.050" end="01:13.500">them </span><span begin="01:13.500" end="01:13.950">girls </span><span begin="01:13.950" end="01:14.250">to </span><span begin="01:14.250" end="01:14.520">go </span><span begin="01:14.520" end="01:15.420">find </span><span begin="01:15.420" end="01:15.720">their </span><span begin="01:15.720" end="01:16.740">own</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.980" end="01:20.130"><span begin="01:16.980" end="01:17.100">I </span><span begin="01:17.100" end="01:17.580">said </span><span begin="01:17.580" end="01:17.700">there's </span><span begin="01:17.700" end="01:18.300">somethin </span><span begin="01:18.300" end="01:18.540">'bout </span><span begin="01:18.540" end="01:18.780">the </span><span begin="01:18.780" end="01:19.200">bad </span><span begin="01:19.200" end="01:20.100">boys</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.130" end="01:22.170"><span begin="01:20.130" end="01:20.400">That </span><span begin="01:20.4